Olivia.


00:22:16.068 --> 00:22:21.665
Olivia, you have a beautiful voice.
Aah! Ha, ha!


00:22:22.240 --> 00:22:25.368
Your band, it's a gift.


00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:27.944
