Winner gets a record deal.


00:22:59.444 --> 00:23:00.911
And some serious air time.


00:23:01.046 --> 00:23:03.571
Making tomorrow's stars today


00:23:04.916 --> 00:23:06.144
Making to-- Making to--


00:23:07.652 --> 00:23:09.210
