- She's so gone
- She's so gone


01:08:01.944 --> 01:08:05.675
You won't find her around


01:08:05.815 --> 01:08:09.080
You can look, but you won't see


01:08:09.218 --> 01:08:12.881
The girl I used to be


01:08:13.022 --> 01:08:15.320
'Cause she


01:08:15.458 --> 01:08:19.053
She's so gone away


01:08:19.195 --> 01:08:21.959
Like history


01:08:22.098 --> 01:08:25.261
She's so gone


01:08:25.835 --> 01:08:30.863
Baby, this is me, yeah


01:08:33.976 --> 01:08:37.241
- She's so gone
- She's so gone


01:08:37.379 --> 01:08:40.610
That's so over now


01:08:40.749 --> 01:08:44.207
- She's so gone
- She's so gone


01:08:44.353 --> 01:08:47.720
You won't find her around


01:08:47.857 --> 01:08:51.418
You can look, but you won't see


01:08:51.560 --> 01:08:55.087
The girl I used to be


01:08:55.231 --> 01:08:57.495
'Cause she


01:08:57.633 --> 01:09:01.000
- She's so gone
- She's so gone


01:09:01.137 --> 01:09:04.300
That's so over now


01:09:04.440 --> 01:09:07.841
- She's so gone
- She's so gone


01:09:07.977 --> 01:09:11.435
