where all our voices could be heard.


01:41:46.533 --> 01:41:47.932
Outside of the basement.


01:41:48.068 --> 01:41:49.592
Congratulations, Miss Reznick.


01:41:49.736 --> 01:41:52.967
Thank you so much. Thank you.


01:41:53.107 --> 01:41:56.668
All right. Let's open up our music hall.


01:41:56.810 --> 01:41:58.744
