- Okay.


01:42:01.715 --> 01:42:03.808
- Here we are.
- We are open.


01:42:03.951 --> 01:42:05.009
Yeah!


01:42:06.920 --> 01:42:09.252
Who would have thought? Stella.


01:42:09.389 --> 01:42:11.084
Stella did all of this.


01:42:11.225 --> 01:42:13.489
Hey, you guys. Cheers.


01:42:13.627 --> 01:42:15.254
- Cheers.
- Cheers.


01:42:15.395 --> 01:42:17.454
- Oh! Ha, ha.
- Cheers.


01:42:19.133 --> 01:42:21.499
- To music.
- To music.


01:42:21.635 --> 01:42:24.035
You know, she'd actually make
a very good principal one day.


01:42:24.171 --> 01:42:25.331
What?


01:42:25.472 --> 01:42:28.134
Well, I used to be a bit
of a rebel myself, back in the day.


01:42:29.643 --> 01:42:30.905
- Really?
- Yeah.


01:42:31.044 --> 01:42:32.909
Oh. Hee-hee. Stanley.


01:42:36.216 --> 01:42:38.081
Lemonade Mouth! Whoo!


01:42:38.218 --> 01:42:43.053
And that, Dad,
is how Lemonade Mouth came to be.


01:42:43.323 --> 01:42:46.690
God, I can't wait to tell you the rest
in person.


01:42:48.829 --> 01:42:51.127
I really miss you, Dad.


01:42:51.265 --> 01:42:54.428
Love, Olivia.


01:43:00.307 --> 01:43:02.332
Oh, I almost forgot, Dad.


01:43:02.476 --> 01:43:05.570
You're never gonna believe
